# shortcuts
Esc - Interrupt Claude, allowing you to redirect or correct it. Also useful to fix issues with \# memries.
Double tap Esc - Rewind the conversation to an earlier point in time. Allows you to maintain valuable context.
/compact - Summarize conversation and continue. Helps Claude stay focused but remember what it has learned in the current session.
/clear - Dumps current conversation history. Useful when switching between different tasks.
